        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Performance Evaluation may also include measurable performance goals tailored to support the business goals of the individual's organization. These performance goals may be specific to the organization, job classification, targets (e.g. Quality, Cost, Delivery, Safety, and Morale), or values.",
